WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.967
Partitioning makes ranking local to a group If we
partition by department

00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:11.789
each department gets its own rank sequence An
employee can be rank one

00:00:11.802 --> 00:00:17.877
in Analytics even if someone in Engineering has a
higher salary The comparison

00:00:17.903 --> 00:00:19.785
set is defined by the partition
